,Dutch,Mystery,"RAT:16:9 HD",Denmark,Musical,"West Germany",Western,Finland,12,Argentina,"MET:300 m",Greece,"OFM:16 mm",10,Netherlands,Russian,UK:15,Australia:G,Belgium,Sport,Philippines,Tagalog,War,8,90,MET:,7,Argentina:13,Danish,Mandarin,Reality-TV,15,Finland:K-16,5,Argentina:Atp,Turkish,2,22}', 'text'::regtype, -1), array_in('{"\"(Hamburg)\". In: \"cinema\", 28.08.1986, (MG)","$127,692 (USA) (28 August 2005)","$270,640 (USA) (3 September 2006)","$526 (USA) (13 January 2008) (4 screens)","''Jackie Shroff'' (qv) wanted ''Shah Rukh Khan'' (qv) to play Munna.",11,180,26,48,75,94,"ARS 839 (Argentina) (9 April 2003) (3 screens)","Alyssa: Let me ask you a question. Can men fuck each other?::Banky Edwards: What, are you asking for my permission?::Alyssa: In your estimation.::Banky Edwards: Sure.::Alyssa: So, for you, to fuck is to penetrate. You''re used to the more traditional definition. You inside some girl you duped, jackhammering away, not noticing that bored look in her eyes.::Banky Edwards: Hey, I always notice that bored look in their eyes, alright?",Argentina:60,Australia:1984,Austria,"Begur, Girona, Cataluña, Spain","Birdy: In a dream, I''m trying to decide what I am. When I sleep I''m giving myself strength. I''m reaching for the force to fly. Perta waits, cups herself to receive me. I hover then lower myself into her. Perta and I become one. I see through her eyes, fly on her wings. I am no longer alone.","Broome, Western Australia, Australia","CAM:Panavision Cameras and Lenses","CONT: The level of the Coke that Chris Burnett drinks in the back of the pick-up truck increases as the ride progresses.","Canada:14 January 2009",Canada:60,"Chiapas, Mexico","Counselor Deanna Troi: I''d book my next vacation at your hotel, if you had one.::Aaron Conor: Well, in that case, I shall have to have them build one.",DTS,Denmark:58,"Dr. Jack Hodgins: I''ll get on the fluid samples you took from the lungs and the esophagus. Could be the vic was drowned somewhere else and dumped in the lake.::Dr. Camille Saroyan: No. Drowning''s not the way that Booth would kill someone. [Hodgins and Wendell stare at Cam] Not... that I... actually... suspect Booth... at all... Quit staring at me.","Espina, Gabriel García. \"Charada\". In: \"ABC\" (Madrid), 29 April 1964, Pg. 95-96, (NP)","Festival selections: - Animafest, Zagreb, Croatia (12-6/17-6-2006) - Festival Internacional de Curtas Metragens, Sao Paulo, Brazil (24-8/2-9-2006) - FICFA Film Festival, Moncton, Canada (15-9/22-9-2006) - Festival Jean Carmet, Moulins, France (4-10-2006) - Murphy''s International Film Festival, Cork, Ireland (8-10/15-10-2006) - Festival Nouveau Cinéma, Montréal, Canada (18-10/28-10-2006) - 28ème Festival Cinéméd, Montpellier, France (27-10/5-11-2006) - Documentary and Animation Film International Festival, Leipzig, Germany (30-10/19-11-2006) - Festival d''Amiens (10-11/19-11-2006) - Rotterdam International Film Festival, The Netherlands (24-1-2007) - Melbourne International Animation Film Festival (19-6/24-6-2007)","Finland:29 November 2006",France:119,"France:4 May 2005","Gentele, Jeanette. \"Massmedier målet för modesatiren\". In: \"Svenska Dagbladet\" (Sweden), 31 March 1995, (NP)",Germany:1991,"Germany:5 June 2011",Greece:1987,"Helsinki, Finland",Hungary,"INR 40,000,000",India:1995,"Italy:11 July 1958","Japan:1 October 1973","Japan:22 April 1985","Japan:9 April 1995","Katrien starts at Winterlicht today and she''s a bit nervous. Julia and Luc try to put her at ease and even Paulien calls from America. Katrien meets an old friend at Winterlicht. Madeleine. They get on right away. Julia misses Paulien and she thinks Katrien also might leave soon. Luc suggests she might take somebody in if she feels alone. Julia pretends she doesn''t know what he means. Simonne doesn''t like Frank''s idea of moving Yvette to a home at all. Tibo thinks Frank might be right, but Franky doesn''t agree at all. Simonne finds out from Julia, Frank asked Katrien if there was room for Yvette at Winterlicht and is furious. Marianne doesn''t want to divorce at all and thinks about how to get Geert back. When Ann just went inside the house for a minute, someone broke into her car and stole her doctor''s bag. Marianne wants to alert the police immediately. Geert doesn''t trust David anymore and he wants him out with the brewers. Either David goes or he goes.","LAB:Technicolor, USA","Lorelei ''Lori'': What are you? C.I.A., Mafia?::Wallace: Both.","MET:2540 m",Malayalam,Mexico:1996,"Mother Superior: You are the perfect example of a how a sow''s ear can be turned into a silk purse.::Sister Mary Clarence: Hmm. Well, I probably wouldn''t put it quite like that.","Netherlands:17 July 2003","New Zealand:7 December 2000","Number 5: Number 5 stupid name... want to be Kevin or Dave!","P.J. McNeal: Aw, look, Frank, it''s a big thing when a sovereign state admits an error. But remember this: there aren''t many governments in the world that would do it.",Paraguay,Philippines:PG-13,"Portugal:18 May 2003","Puerto Rico","Released as a split reel along with the documentary _Forbidden City in Pekin, China (1917)_ (qv).","Russia:25 June 2006","Serbia:19 July 2012","Sir Simon Loveit, a widower, wishes to marry Miss Biddy. His son, Captain Bob, however has already won her heart under the alias of Rhodophil, before he went to war in Flanders. On his return, Captain Bob discovers, courtesy of his manservant Puff, that Miss has two other suitors, Captain Flash and Mr. Fribble. Puff also discovers that his wife, Tag, who he deserted six months ago, has been having an affair with Sir Simon''s manservant, Jasper. After coercing Flash and Fribble into a duelling stand-off, Miss Biddy and Tag watch the ensuing chaos with glee as Captain Bob chases off his rivals. Sir Simon relinquishes his attachment to Miss Biddy, leaving true love to win the day.","Spain:1 October 1999","Spain:20 February 1996","Spain:4 December 1999","Stage 17, Warner Brothers Burbank Studios - 4000 Warner Boulevard, Burbank, California, USA",Sweden,Swedish,Telugu,"The end titles include the credit \"Special thanks to H.P. Lovecraft for being public domain.\"","The title is based upon a quote from ''William Shakespeare (I)'' (qv)''s play \"Romeo and Juliet\": (Act II, Scene II): \"What''s in a name? That which we call a rose by any other name would smell as sweet\".","Todd Smith: Hey Jenny, I think I need to take the gay test again?::Jenny Kolinsky: Not on your life, Todd.::Hannah B. Williams: I''ll give you the test.::Todd Smith: Nah, that''s okay Hannah.","UK:1 September 2007","UK:16 September 1996","UK:21 January 1962","UK:3 December 1971","UK:8 September 1995","USA:1 March 1925","USA:11 March 2002","USA:13 November 2011","USA:15 September 1933","USA:18 January 2012","USA:2 June 2009",USA:2007,"USA:22 October 2012","USA:25 June 2011","USA:28 August 1917","USA:3 November 1995","USA:4 December 1948","USA:6 April 2012","USA:8 April 2011",USA:Approved,"USA:October 1984","Universal Studios - 100 Universal City Plaza, Universal City, California, USA","West Berlin, Berlin, Germany","When homecoming is around the corner, Jerri is desperate to become Queen. So she secretly removes all the nominees except her own and another nerdy student. The only problem is when she hears that everyone else is going to be voting for the other nominee because of her inner beauty, Jerri begins to think of a plan that will for sure make her win.","[Hawkeye and B.J. bid farewell to each other]::Hawkeye: Look, I know how tough it is for you to say goodbye, so I''LL say it. Maybe you''re right, maybe we WILL see each other again, but just in case we don''t, I want you to know how much you''ve meant to me. I''ll never be able to shake you; whenever I see a pair of big feet or a cheesy mustache, I''ll think of you.::B.J.: Whenever I smell month-old socks, I''ll think of YOU.::Hawkeye: Or the next time somebody nails my shoe to the floor...::B.J.: ...or when somebody gives me a martini that tastes like lighter fluid.::Hawkeye: I''ll miss you.::B.J.: I''ll miss YOU. A lot. I can''t imagine what this place would''ve been like if I hadn''t found you here.",£200,"€ 965,258 (Belgium) (11 March 2012)"}', 'text'::regtype, -1), NULL, NULL, NULL);
